1
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,000
What are you doing? It's just a scratch.

2
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:46,799
I'm sorry.

3
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,120
I failed to protect you.

4
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:50,159
We're both cops. Who protects who?

5
00:01:50,879 --> 00:01:51,799
But you're a female comrade.

6
00:01:52,719 --> 00:01:54,120
Gender doesn't matter on a mission.

7
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,200
It does when you get hurt.

8
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:57,000
This wound is on your face.

9
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,680
What if you can't get married later?

10
00:01:58,799 --> 00:02:00,000
It's none of your business if I can't.

11
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,400
It's so frustrating.

12
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:06,239
What's so frustrating about it?

13
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,319
You were protecting the people.

14
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:10,280
It's a heroic injury.

15
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:24,919
Is the wound big?

16
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,120
Not really.

17
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:30,159
Is it infected?

18
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,080
Go find me a mirror.

19
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,879
Where would I find a mirror here?

20
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,240
Then give me my phone.

21
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,400
It's dead.

22
00:02:38,919 --> 00:02:39,199
Let me use yours.

23
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:40,719
Mine's dead too.

24
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,039
Go away, stop bothering me.

25
00:02:48,319 --> 00:02:48,840
Wait, doctor.

26
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,599
Do you really need such a long needle?

27
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,000
This is just a standard suture needle.

28
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,360
Will it leave a scar?

29
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:57,479
Well, it's hard to say.

30
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,000
It depends on how she heals.

31
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:00,719
Her wound is very long.

32
00:03:00,919 --> 00:03:01,520
It needs stitches.

33
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,280
There's a possibility of scarring.

34
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,000
No way.

35
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,039
She's only 24.

36
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:06,120
She hasn't even had a boyfriend yet.

37
00:03:06,159 --> 00:03:07,039
She absolutely cannot have a scar.

38
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:08,639
Stop bothering me.

39
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,400
Go wait outside.

40
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,360
Out!

41
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:24,680
Um, doctor,

42
00:03:24,719 --> 00:03:26,120
when you stitch me up later,

43
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:28,080
could you please do it neatly?

44
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,919
Okay, don't worry.

45
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:31,120
We'll handle it carefully.

46
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,639
We'll try to make it look nice.

47
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,800
Okay, thanks.

48
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:42,319
Yes, a forehead injury. Hit by a brick.

49
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,719
Not a bad guy. My comrade-in-arms.

50
00:03:48,719 --> 00:03:49,280
A woman.

51
00:03:50,240 --> 00:03:52,120
Alright, Mom, stop prying.

52
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:55,520
No way.

53
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,319
I won't feel at ease unless you do it.

54
00:03:57,599 --> 00:03:58,360
She absolutely cannot have a scar.

55
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,280
Right now.

56
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:02,680
Get everything ready, I'll be right there.

57
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,800
Have you had anesthesia?

58
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:06,199
No.

59
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:07,639
It's going to hurt a bit.

60
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:08,120
Lie down first.

61
00:04:11,919 --> 00:04:12,360
Doctor, stop!

62
00:04:14,639 --> 00:04:16,199
What are you doing? What are you doing?

63
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:18,360
We're not getting stitches here.

64
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,319
We're going somewhere else.

65
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:28,839
Okay.

66
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:29,959
Right here.

67
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:32,920
Come on.

68
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:36,160
Well, this...

69
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,800
Some moderate exercise will do.

70
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:39,399
No need. Why compete with them?

71
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:40,160
Undo it.

72
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:41,519
Here, here.

73
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:41,920
Is this the spot?

74
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:42,439
I... I...

75
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:43,040
I'll do it myself.

76
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:45,240
Old Zhao.

77
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,279
Sometimes you just have to compete.

78
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:49,040
These young people...

79
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:50,959
They're always in such a rush.

80
00:04:51,639 --> 00:04:52,079
It's... it's... it's...

81
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:52,839
So unreliable.

82
00:04:53,199 --> 00:04:53,439
Yes.

83
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:54,000
Yes.

84
00:04:54,199 --> 00:04:55,800
If they were like you,

85
00:04:56,199 --> 00:04:57,040
mature and steady,

86
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,920
would things have gotten to this point?

87
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:00,240
Have a seat.

88
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,079
I'm not up to it anymore.

89
00:05:01,519 --> 00:05:01,879
Chief.

90
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,120
I... I have...

91
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,160
this high blood pressure now.

92
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,279
Sometimes when I check it,

93
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,399
it's up to 150 or 160.

94
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,399
Hitting 150 or 160 just like that,

95
00:05:07,399 --> 00:05:08,160
is pretty scary.

96
00:05:08,279 --> 00:05:08,879
Are you taking medicine?

97
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,519
I am. I'm taking it.

98
00:05:11,879 --> 00:05:12,319
Then you must

99
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:13,360
be careful.

100
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:15,199
But, well...

101
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,800
a place like the Special Police Unit,

102
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,040
it has to be young people.

103
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,279
They need to have fighting spirit.

104
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:22,639
They're needed for frontline emergencies.

105
00:05:23,639 --> 00:05:24,199
And also,

106
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:25,519
Chief Guo,

107
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:26,839
about this...

108
00:05:27,279 --> 00:05:28,120
About this...

109
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,079
what happened today,

110
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,360
if the Special Police Unit is at fault,

111
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:31,480
hasn't been finally determined yet.

112
00:05:32,079 --> 00:05:32,600
That's not right.

113
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,600
With this situation now,

114
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:36,000
it's not a matter of right or wrong.

115
00:05:37,279 --> 00:05:37,720
Old Zhao.

116
00:05:38,279 --> 00:05:39,199
As for public opinion,

117
00:05:39,639 --> 00:05:41,680
you must keep a close eye on it.

118
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:42,680
Yes, yes, sir.

119
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:44,279
I... I have already thought of

120
00:05:44,439 --> 00:05:44,800
countermeasures.

121
00:05:45,399 --> 00:05:47,240
I... I've listed three points.

122
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,680
Please review them, Chief Guo.

123
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,680
First,

124
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,399
we must actively guide

125
00:05:52,199 --> 00:05:52,519
public opinion.

126
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,600
Promptly release official updates.

127
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:56,680
You have to announce to the public

128
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,560
the progress and resolution.

129
00:05:59,480 --> 00:05:59,879
Second,

130
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,639
strengthen monitoring and early warning.

131
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:05,120
Stay updated on public opinion trends.

132
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:06,720
This is very important.

133
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:07,759
Third,

134
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,680
Establish a rapid response mechanism.

135
00:06:10,319 --> 00:06:11,600
Ensure that when public opinion shifts,

136
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:13,000
we can swiftly

137
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:14,439
occupy the high ground of public opinion.

138
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,959
This is why older comrades are reliable.

139
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,079
Guohua,

140
00:06:22,959 --> 00:06:24,240
no matter what you handle,

141
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:26,000
I'm always completely at ease.

142
00:06:27,439 --> 00:06:28,759
Chief Guo, it's thanks to your leadership.

143
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:32,680
Why is it

144
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:33,639
cold?

145
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,399
The medicine is kicking in.

146
00:06:36,839 --> 00:06:37,680
It will warm up in a bit.

147
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:39,560
Really?

148
00:06:41,399 --> 00:06:42,120
It feels really comfortable.

149
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:57,839
Boss Lu

150
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:04,920
It's been handled.

151
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:07,800
I've sent her to the chemical plant.

152
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,560
Her family is taken care of too.

153
00:07:10,079 --> 00:07:10,879
The money has been paid.

154
00:07:11,439 --> 00:07:12,079
In a couple of days,

155
00:07:12,879 --> 00:07:14,199
I'm planning to send her abroad.

156
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,000
I guarantee no one will talk.

157
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:20,680
Boss Lu,

158
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,639
what do we do about those two brothers?

159
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,439
Right now, they're a time bomb.

160
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,720
Have someone find them.

161
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,639
If they don't want to leave,

162
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:40,240
then they stay.

163
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,240
Then should I

164
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,240
get some good fighters to shadow you?

165
00:07:44,959 --> 00:07:46,279
To stop them from causing trouble again?

166
00:07:46,279 --> 00:07:47,360
You don't need to worry about manpower.

167
00:07:48,399 --> 00:07:49,800
Just do your own job.

168
00:07:51,519 --> 00:07:52,480
As for the convenience store,

169
00:07:53,879 --> 00:07:55,000
make sure you keep a close eye on it.

170
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,519
Got it.

171
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:04,360
By the way, Boss Lu.

172
00:08:04,839 --> 00:08:05,680
Per your instructions,

173
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,680
we hired a few more marketing accounts

174
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:10,199
to fan the flames a bit.

175
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:15,360
Don't skimp where money needs spending.

176
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,560
Things haven't blown up enough yet.

177
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,079
Not big enough?

178
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,560
This involves the club.

179
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:24,160
I'm afraid if it gets too big, won't it...

180
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,600
It's already out in the open.

181
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,800
There's no hiding it anyway.

182
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,000
We're in the right.

183
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,600
No need to fear what others say.

184
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,840
Didn't your sister-in-law find a backer?

185
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,919
Let's use this chance to fan the flames,

186
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,360
and help her test out

187
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,759
whether this backer is truly reliable

188
00:08:46,039 --> 00:08:47,000
or not.

189
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,159
Brother Lü Xiao.

190
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,799
You rushed over here so quickly,

191
00:09:08,799 --> 00:09:09,879
you probably haven't had time to eat.

192
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,080
Why don't you have a bite first?

193
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:12,159
Thanks.

194
00:09:12,639 --> 00:09:13,559
I'm not in the mood right now.

195
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,600
The director is handling it personally.

196
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,399
Are you still worried?

197
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:18,159
I'm relieved,

198
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:20,799
but still worried.

199
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,879
How do you know Lü Xiao, miss?

200
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:41,799
Comrades-in-arms.

201
00:09:42,799 --> 00:09:43,759
Just comrades-in-arms?

202
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,559
I think he cares about you a lot.

203
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:50,440
We both joined the Special Police Unit.

204
00:09:50,559 --> 00:09:51,919
So we interact a bit more.

205
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:53,639
We're also friends.

206
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:55,200
Take a look. If it's fine, please sign.

207
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:55,919
Okay.

208
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:03,720
What do you think of Lü Xiao?

209
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,679
He's a good guy.

210
00:10:07,559 --> 00:10:08,200
Is he?

211
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,399
I don't see what's so good about him.

212
00:10:12,399 --> 00:10:15,080
Director, are you close with Lü Xiao?

213
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,080
Not really.

214
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:18,360
Him?

215
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:20,720
Unless it's something important,

216
00:10:21,279 --> 00:10:22,720
he wouldn't contact me on his own.

217
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,879
Then you two are...

218
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,679
I'm his mother.

219
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,559
But you look to be in your thirties!

220
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:32,840
Miss, you really know how to talk.

221
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,120
And you look very healthy.

222
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,919
I always thought you were in poor health.

223
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:41,159
What makes you say that?

224
00:10:41,799 --> 00:10:44,000
Lü Xiao always uses that excuse for leave.

225
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,000
He never changes his bad habits.

226
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:49,039
He did the same thing back in school.

227
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,600
He hasn't improved at all.

228
00:10:52,679 --> 00:10:53,559
That brat.

229
00:10:54,159 --> 00:10:55,080
Can't he wish me well?

230
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,279
Miss, you don't have a boyfriend, do you?

231
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,080
How did you know?

232
00:11:05,279 --> 00:11:06,480
If you had a boyfriend,

233
00:11:06,799 --> 00:11:08,480
would Lü Xiao be the one waiting outside?

234
00:11:16,639 --> 00:11:17,320
Comrade Officer,

235
00:11:17,919 --> 00:11:18,919
I've told you so many times.

236
00:11:19,639 --> 00:11:21,320
I may not work for Luxury Home Decoration,

237
00:11:21,879 --> 00:11:22,720
my relative is!

238
00:11:23,399 --> 00:11:25,279
I went to demand money for my family.

239
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:26,799
There's nothing wrong with that, right?

240
00:11:27,519 --> 00:11:28,639
You guys are really something.

241
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,080
You don't arrest the people who owe money,

242
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:31,080
but you arrest us for demanding our wages.

243
00:11:31,080 --> 00:11:32,159
Were you just demanding wages?

244
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,440
Why did you hurt someone with a rock?

245
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,840
I was hot-headed and lost control.

246
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,159
How about this?

247
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,440
You make Elite Club pay us back,

248
00:11:40,879 --> 00:11:42,720
and I'll pay for that girl's medical bills.

249
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:43,919
You hit a police officer.

250
00:11:44,279 --> 00:11:45,240
Attacking police is a crime, understand?

251
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,279
This isn't about money.

252
00:11:47,919 --> 00:11:50,279
We just went to get our hard-earned money.

253
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,200
How is that a crime?

254
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:53,559
Besides,

255
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,879
we didn't mean to hit the police.

256
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,360
I don't care if it was on purpose or not.

257
00:11:58,320 --> 00:12:00,080
You injured an officer, that's a fact.

258
00:12:00,399 --> 00:12:00,759
Right?

259
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:03,639
Let me ask you.

260
00:12:04,679 --> 00:12:05,519
Do you know those two people?

261
00:12:06,519 --> 00:12:07,200
No.

262
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,399
It was my first time seeing them.

263
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:12,600
We asked Luxury Home Decoration's workers.

264
00:12:13,519 --> 00:12:15,240
None of them saw you three at the site.

265
00:12:16,159 --> 00:12:18,240
Also, their testimonies match perfectly.

266
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,919
They all claim to be helping relatives.

267
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:21,960
And one of them

268
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,879
is even an organizer of this protest.

269
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,759
I think they deliberately colluded

270
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,000
to cause trouble.

271
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,200
Don't tell me what you think.

272
00:12:28,639 --> 00:12:29,480
We are the police.

273
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,600
We must speak with facts and evidence.

274
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:33,799
So what if they colluded?

275
00:12:34,879 --> 00:12:36,799
Uniting to demand wages isn't wrong.

276
00:12:40,399 --> 00:12:41,159
Can you confirm

277
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,320
they were really doing it for relatives?

278
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:46,159
Chief, confirming that will take time.

279
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:47,840
At the construction site,

280
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,120
people come and go constantly.

281
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:50,399
The turnover is just too high.

282
00:12:51,159 --> 00:12:52,799
But these three are definitely suspicious.

283
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:53,919
Their stories are too rehearsed.

284
00:12:53,919 --> 00:12:54,320
Right.

285
00:12:54,519 --> 00:12:55,279
Another thing is that it feels like

286
00:12:55,279 --> 00:12:57,080
they were fully prepared

287
00:12:57,399 --> 00:12:58,000
to be arrested.

288
00:12:59,799 --> 00:13:01,000
It's hard for us to determine that.

289
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,759
You guys go and verify first

290
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:04,799
if they really did it for their relatives.

291
00:13:05,799 --> 00:13:06,919
It's not easy to ask for wages.

292
00:13:07,799 --> 00:13:09,159
Unless they're causing trouble on purpose,

293
00:13:09,919 --> 00:13:11,519
we should still focus our work on

294
00:13:11,559 --> 00:13:12,679
how to help them get their wages.

295
00:13:12,879 --> 00:13:13,320
Alright.

296
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:13,679
Yes, sir.

297
00:13:27,399 --> 00:13:28,000
Commissar Tan.

298
00:13:28,519 --> 00:13:29,080
You're back.

299
00:13:31,559 --> 00:13:33,600
When Director Ji saw the flowers I sent,

300
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,120
did she say anything?

301
00:13:37,919 --> 00:13:38,639
She told me to take them away.

302
00:13:40,440 --> 00:13:41,080
She didn't accept them?

303
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:42,600
But then she told me to put them back.

304
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,159
And then?

305
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,840
She took a picture of the flowers.

306
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:51,320
Then she made me recite the police code.

307
00:13:52,799 --> 00:13:54,679
How did she look after taking it?

308
00:13:55,279 --> 00:13:55,679
She smiled.

309
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,080
She smiled.

310
00:14:29,639 --> 00:14:30,039
All right.

311
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,519
Yeah, I know.

312
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,360
We'll head back this afternoon.

313
00:14:44,279 --> 00:14:44,759
I know.

314
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:49,320
Don't worry, I won't hold up training.

315
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:51,600
Okay.

316
00:14:54,000 --> 00:14:54,600
What?

317
00:14:54,919 --> 00:14:55,720
Eavesdropping on my call?

318
00:14:56,879 --> 00:14:57,879
You rarely come back for a visit,

319
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,200
but you'd rather hide out in the hospital

320
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:00,120
than sleep at home?

321
00:15:01,879 --> 00:15:04,159
I'm looking after the wounded, aren't I?

322
00:15:04,159 --> 00:15:04,879
Oh, please.

323
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:06,919
Next time, I'll come back just for you.

324
00:15:09,519 --> 00:15:10,279
Tell me the truth.

325
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,320
Do you like her?

326
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,200
Don't talk nonsense.

327
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,720
Didn't I tell you we're just colleagues?

328
00:15:15,039 --> 00:15:15,879
She's not my type.

329
00:15:18,159 --> 00:15:19,679
You're saying she's not your type?

330
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,360
As if she cares if you like her!

331
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,639
Take a good look at yourself,

332
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:24,919
Comrade Xiao Lü.

333
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:28,200
Come home for dinner.

334
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,879
I'm not his type?

335
00:15:33,799 --> 00:15:34,360
Impossible.

336
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:47,480
You're awake.

337
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,080
Don't touch the wound.

338
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:50,240
Does it hurt?

339
00:15:50,639 --> 00:15:51,240
A little.

340
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:57,480
Did you watch over me all night?

341
00:15:58,399 --> 00:15:59,240
Of course.

342
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:02,879
Bai Jiani,

343
00:16:03,919 --> 00:16:06,919
Not only do you kick the covers off,

344
00:16:07,720 --> 00:16:08,720
but you also snore.

345
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:10,759
I recorded it for you.

346
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:11,759
Let me find it.

347
00:16:13,919 --> 00:16:14,399
Are you hungry?

348
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:17,879
I am.

349
00:16:18,279 --> 00:16:19,080
Brother Lü Xiao,

350
00:16:20,919 --> 00:16:22,360
I brought breakfast. Try some.

351
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:23,799
Perfect. You eat it.

352
00:16:25,799 --> 00:16:26,200
Xiao Liu,

353
00:16:26,799 --> 00:16:27,799
generally speaking,

354
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:29,559
will this kind of wound leave a scar?

355
00:16:30,080 --> 00:16:32,159
To avoid a scar, you must watch your diet.

356
00:16:32,799 --> 00:16:33,519
Especially spicy food.

357
00:16:38,159 --> 00:16:39,519
Why don't you eat the egg?

358
00:16:39,519 --> 00:16:40,440
The egg isn't spicy.

359
00:16:43,799 --> 00:16:44,639
I...

360
00:16:45,159 --> 00:16:46,000
can't eat this.

361
00:16:47,039 --> 00:16:47,799
This isn't just an egg.

362
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:50,039
It's that girl's deep affection for you.

363
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:50,919
You eat it.

364
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:53,879
It's just an egg.

365
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:56,320
What do you want to eat?

366
00:16:59,000 --> 00:16:59,879
Suddenly I'm not hungry anymore.

367
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:06,839
One!

368
00:17:08,079 --> 00:17:08,519
Two!

369
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:10,400
Three!

370
00:17:13,839 --> 00:17:14,720
Down! Stop!

371
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:15,759
About face!

372
00:17:15,799 --> 00:17:16,200
Down!

373
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:18,880
Down!

374
00:17:20,759 --> 00:17:21,200
Two!

375
00:17:22,119 --> 00:17:22,519
Down!

376
00:17:22,759 --> 00:17:23,160
Stop!

377
00:17:25,039 --> 00:17:25,880
Down! Stop!

378
00:17:27,599 --> 00:17:28,319
About face!

379
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:30,440
Down!

380
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,400
The Municipal Bureau's opinion

381
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:35,119
is that we must handle the public opinion

382
00:17:35,119 --> 00:17:36,519
with a practical response.

383
00:17:37,519 --> 00:17:39,359
They're just doing a simple investigation.

384
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:41,960
Just cooperate with them.

385
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,880
Your judgment is off, too.

386
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:45,640
Trust me.

387
00:17:45,640 --> 00:17:47,680
This investigation is just a formality.

388
00:17:48,359 --> 00:17:49,200
Don't be so nervous.

389
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:50,279
I'm not nervous.

390
00:17:51,480 --> 00:17:53,079
Don't they want to investigate?

391
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:54,839
Let them.

392
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:56,880
The more thorough, the better.

393
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:03,240
I still have a few days of annual leave.

394
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:05,480
Approve them for me.

395
00:18:06,119 --> 00:18:07,680
I can just go home and get some rest.

396
00:18:20,279 --> 00:18:21,400
At a time like this,

397
00:18:23,119 --> 00:18:24,200
you can't act out of spite.

398
00:18:25,359 --> 00:18:26,400
You can't just walk away.

399
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,200
I'm not walking away.

400
00:18:27,599 --> 00:18:29,480
I'm specifically clearing my schedule

401
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,559
to fully cooperate with the investigation.

402
00:18:32,319 --> 00:18:33,359
I just think

403
00:18:33,599 --> 00:18:35,119
that the more critical the moment,

404
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,480
the more you need to stay calm.

405
00:18:40,359 --> 00:18:42,400
Learn to turn crises into opportunities.

406
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:44,799
Show the city leaders you're level-headed.

407
00:18:45,200 --> 00:18:46,720
Let them see how a truly strong person

408
00:18:47,079 --> 00:18:48,400
should carry themselves.

409
00:18:48,519 --> 00:18:49,079
Commissar Tan,

410
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,880
I'm really not feeling well.

411
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:53,000
What's wrong with you?

412
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:53,960
My chest hurts.

413
00:18:55,079 --> 00:18:56,039
Just approve my leave already.

414
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:57,039
Thanks.

415
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:12,400
Come in.

416
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:16,400
Chief Guo, you wanted to see me?

417
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:19,519
What's the matter?

418
00:19:20,400 --> 00:19:22,680
I heard the Inspection Team is here.

419
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:24,240
Are you upset?

420
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:27,519
I'm not upset, Chief Guo.

421
00:19:27,640 --> 00:19:28,680
I just want to take a break.

422
00:19:30,759 --> 00:19:31,519
Take a break?

423
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:37,759
Taking a break is good.

424
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:41,519
You really do need to relax.

425
00:19:43,119 --> 00:19:43,519
Look.

426
00:19:45,359 --> 00:19:47,279
My son bought me this thing.

427
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:47,920
You recognize it, right?

428
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:49,680
It's an ab wheel.

429
00:19:50,319 --> 00:19:50,920
An ab wheel.

430
00:19:52,079 --> 00:19:53,079
I'm getting old.

431
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:54,759
Those...

432
00:19:55,759 --> 00:19:57,359
big tires at the Special Police Unit...

433
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:58,279
I can't push them anymore.

434
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,240
Come, sit.

435
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:13,039
Liao Bufan

436
00:20:14,599 --> 00:20:16,920
When I first met you at the Special Police Unit,

437
00:20:18,119 --> 00:20:19,559
I knew you had great potential.

438
00:20:20,799 --> 00:20:22,119
You're a hot-blooded kid,

439
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:23,640
straightforward,

440
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:25,279
and never back down.

441
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:26,920
You always speak your mind.

442
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,400
And because of this exact personality,

443
00:20:30,200 --> 00:20:30,880
that you're able to lead

444
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:32,759
such a fiercely spirited team.

445
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:35,519
Thank you, Chief Guo.

446
00:20:36,079 --> 00:20:37,920
Hearing you say that makes it all worth it.

447
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,319
When I joined the Special Police Unit,

448
00:20:46,839 --> 00:20:47,880
out of so many people,

449
00:20:50,319 --> 00:20:51,480
you spotted me right away.

450
00:20:54,440 --> 00:20:56,000
And I went from a regular officer

451
00:20:56,480 --> 00:20:58,000
to becoming the Commander today.

452
00:20:59,880 --> 00:21:01,839
I know my personality

453
00:21:02,559 --> 00:21:03,599
annoys a lot of people,

454
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:04,680
and offends many too.

455
00:21:05,880 --> 00:21:07,480
But really, Chief Guo,

456
00:21:11,359 --> 00:21:12,880
having a leader like you around

457
00:21:13,279 --> 00:21:14,400
really gives me confidence.

458
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:15,559
That's why

459
00:21:17,119 --> 00:21:18,559
I wasn't wrong about you.

460
00:21:19,720 --> 00:21:21,359
This quality of yours

461
00:21:21,759 --> 00:21:22,920
is incredibly precious.

462
00:21:24,279 --> 00:21:26,400
You have to keep it up, Liao Bufan.

463
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:31,559
However,

464
00:21:33,359 --> 00:21:34,400
in this line of work,

465
00:21:35,599 --> 00:21:36,599
a lot of times,

466
00:21:37,279 --> 00:21:38,519
you still have to think things through.

467
00:21:39,559 --> 00:21:40,039
Right?

468
00:21:42,079 --> 00:21:43,319
You should strive to be

469
00:21:44,599 --> 00:21:46,039
firm inside, flexible outside.

470
00:21:47,599 --> 00:21:49,880
Just like you and Tan Yan,

471
00:21:50,519 --> 00:21:51,279
you two have different personalities.

472
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:54,440
So your methods for handling things

473
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:55,319
are also different.

474
00:21:56,599 --> 00:21:57,920
In the future, I hope you both

475
00:21:57,960 --> 00:21:59,400
can put aside your prejudices

476
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:01,480
and cooperate a little better.

477
00:22:02,319 --> 00:22:03,480
That way, for the Special Police Unit,

478
00:22:03,559 --> 00:22:04,880
what mission couldn't be completed?

479
00:22:06,759 --> 00:22:07,279
Am I right?

480
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:09,880
It's just like this ab wheel.

481
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:13,880
You must be of one mind and pull together.

482
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:15,680
Then doing it would just be...

483
00:22:18,759 --> 00:22:19,720
I'm fine, I'm fine, I'm fine!

484
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:20,400
I'm fine.

485
00:22:21,279 --> 00:22:21,720
This...

486
00:22:22,480 --> 00:22:24,240
This thing is actually pretty tricky.

487
00:22:28,359 --> 00:22:29,519
See, you do know how to smile.

488
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:33,720
And quite brightly, too.

489
00:22:37,880 --> 00:22:38,559
In the future,

490
00:22:39,599 --> 00:22:40,920
don't make me worry so much.

491
00:22:42,599 --> 00:22:43,400
Got it, Chief Guo.

492
00:23:03,480 --> 00:23:04,359
Go back and get some rest.

493
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:06,200
I'm fine now, Chief Guo.

494
00:23:06,279 --> 00:23:06,759
I'm fine.

495
00:23:07,079 --> 00:23:07,680
I'll head back then.

496
00:23:07,759 --> 00:23:08,079
Go on back.

497
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:23,359
Make sure to keep the wound dry.

498
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:24,839
Take the oral medication for three days.

499
00:23:25,440 --> 00:23:27,000
And definitely no makeup.

500
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:28,480
I never wear makeup anyway.

501
00:23:28,559 --> 00:23:30,319
Mom, prescribe her some painkillers too.

502
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:31,160
No need.

503
00:23:31,400 --> 00:23:32,359
I feel much better now.

504
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:35,119
Change the dressing every three days.

505
00:23:35,440 --> 00:23:36,599
Just be careful it doesn't get infected.

506
00:23:37,119 --> 00:23:37,480
Okay.

507
00:23:37,480 --> 00:23:39,240
Mom, it definitely won't scar, right?

508
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,440
I didn't guarantee that.

509
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:44,000
Didn't you say it wouldn't leave a scar?

510
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:44,839
Why are you changing your story now?

511
00:23:45,039 --> 00:23:46,440
What are you nagging about?

512
00:23:46,759 --> 00:23:47,839
You're acting fussier than she is.

513
00:23:47,839 --> 00:23:50,039
It's fine. It just takes time to heal.

514
00:23:51,440 --> 00:23:52,119
Go pay the bill.

515
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:52,960
I'll go pay it.

516
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:54,759
He brought you here, let him pay.

517
00:23:54,759 --> 00:23:55,640
Come, have a seat.

518
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:56,240
Over six thousand?

519
00:23:56,240 --> 00:23:56,920
Is this a rip-off joint?

520
00:23:57,319 --> 00:23:58,359
One cosmetic adhesive is 1,200?

521
00:23:59,640 --> 00:24:00,920
Didn't you ask for the best?

522
00:24:01,119 --> 00:24:02,279
Now you're complaining it's too expensive.

523
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:07,000
Mom, it's a family business.

524
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:08,000
Let's just treat it as a formality.

525
00:24:08,759 --> 00:24:09,640
I'll sign for it. I'll sign.

526
00:24:10,119 --> 00:24:10,960
Stop right there.

527
00:24:11,359 --> 00:24:12,559
We don't offer credit here.

528
00:24:13,279 --> 00:24:14,960
Hurry up, the cashier is getting off work.

529
00:24:15,839 --> 00:24:16,759
I should be the one to go.

530
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:18,359
You stay seated.

531
00:24:18,359 --> 00:24:19,279
This... this isn't right.

532
00:24:19,559 --> 00:24:19,799
Ma'am.

533
00:24:19,799 --> 00:24:20,960
It's fine. It's totally fine.

534
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:26,440
Jiani, what's your Chinese zodiac sign?

535
00:24:28,119 --> 00:24:28,799
I'm a Rabbit.

536
00:24:29,559 --> 00:24:30,519
You're a Rabbit?

537
00:24:31,559 --> 00:24:33,240
Our little brat is a Rabbit too.

538
00:24:34,079 --> 00:24:35,440
I'm a Rabbit too.

539
00:24:36,680 --> 00:24:38,480
In the future, if he ever bullies you,

540
00:24:38,640 --> 00:24:39,559
just tell me.

541
00:24:39,759 --> 00:24:40,640
I'll teach him a lesson.

542
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:42,640
Thank you.

543
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:45,119
Come over for dinner sometime.

544
00:24:45,559 --> 00:24:46,039
Okay.

545
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:52,400
Commissar Tan!

546
00:24:52,480 --> 00:24:53,039
Commissar Tan!

547
00:24:53,079 --> 00:24:54,319
Our man was the one who got beaten.

548
00:24:54,359 --> 00:24:55,839
Why is Commander Liao being investigated?

549
00:24:56,519 --> 00:24:56,640
Yeah!

550
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:57,039
Why?

551
00:24:57,039 --> 00:24:57,880
Under those circumstances,

552
00:24:58,160 --> 00:24:59,440
what was wrong with Commander Liao's call?

553
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:01,599
This is unfair to Commander Liao!

554
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:02,880
We can all go testify. Let's go!

555
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:03,720
Right, let's go testify!

556
00:25:05,039 --> 00:25:06,640
I'll strip the uniform of anyone who goes!

557
00:25:14,799 --> 00:25:16,759
The Special Police Unit aren't outlaws.

558
00:25:18,759 --> 00:25:20,720
This is about Commander Liao's innocence,

559
00:25:21,559 --> 00:25:23,160
as well as our police force's image

560
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:24,480
and law enforcement authority.

561
00:25:26,640 --> 00:25:28,480
Our public opinion response mechanism

562
00:25:29,039 --> 00:25:29,799
is very robust.

563
00:25:30,359 --> 00:25:31,400
Regarding the incident in question,

564
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:34,480
a thorough analysis will be conducted.

565
00:25:35,279 --> 00:25:36,519
You must trust the organization.

566
00:25:37,079 --> 00:25:38,480
A conclusion will be reached soon.

567
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:44,839
Enough.

568
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:46,839
All of you, go back.

569
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:47,920
Get back to your training.

570
00:25:47,920 --> 00:25:48,880
Get back to your duties.

571
00:25:52,440 --> 00:25:53,599
Move it, move it, move it!

572
00:25:56,400 --> 00:25:57,000
About-face!

573
00:25:58,079 --> 00:25:58,680
Forward march!

574
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:15,200
With your skill level,

575
00:26:15,680 --> 00:26:18,319
want to win the Combat Skills Competition?

576
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,920
Keep up this attitude,

577
00:26:23,359 --> 00:26:24,680
and you'll come in dead last.

578
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:28,319
Your problem isn't physical fitness,

579
00:26:29,279 --> 00:26:31,039
it's your mindset.

580
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:34,279
Did what happened to Liao Bufan

581
00:26:35,519 --> 00:26:37,200
make you all lose your motivation?

582
00:26:41,200 --> 00:26:41,920
I can understand it.

583
00:26:41,920 --> 00:26:43,359
It's about brotherhood, after all.

584
00:26:47,079 --> 00:26:47,480
Report!

585
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:48,160
Report!

586
00:26:53,839 --> 00:26:54,559
Reporting, Commissar.

587
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:55,759
Got a few stitches. I'm fine now.

588
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:56,880
How many stitches?

589
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:57,880
Over a dozen.

590
00:26:59,240 --> 00:27:00,599
But it's a cosmetic suture. It's fine.

591
00:27:06,359 --> 00:27:07,559
Then skip training for a couple of days.

592
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:08,680
Here, you take notes.

593
00:27:08,839 --> 00:27:10,079
Whoever has a bad attitude,

594
00:27:10,079 --> 00:27:10,680
write their names down.

595
00:27:11,319 --> 00:27:12,400
Got it. Thank you, Commissar.

596
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:14,279
Have some water, Naonao.

597
00:27:15,400 --> 00:27:16,799
All done. Great job.

598
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:34,480
Uncle Liao!

599
00:27:38,440 --> 00:27:39,079
What are you playing?

600
00:27:40,359 --> 00:27:41,160
Building Legos.

601
00:27:42,759 --> 00:27:43,759
Did you miss Uncle Liao?

602
00:27:44,079 --> 00:27:44,519
I did.

603
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:46,079
Did you really?

604
00:27:46,759 --> 00:27:47,119
Good.

605
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:48,880
You're here.

606
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:49,680
What can I get you?

607
00:27:49,799 --> 00:27:50,880
Give me some glue.

608
00:27:51,720 --> 00:27:52,480
What are you gluing?

609
00:27:52,799 --> 00:27:53,200
Leather.

610
00:27:53,839 --> 00:27:54,480
Leather.

611
00:27:55,960 --> 00:27:57,119
You haven't built anything yet.

612
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:58,599
No training today?

613
00:27:58,960 --> 00:27:59,599
I'm on leave.

614
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:01,559
On leave again?

615
00:28:02,519 --> 00:28:04,160
Uncle Liao's tired. Taking a few days off.

616
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,039
Even you get tired?

617
00:28:06,319 --> 00:28:07,039
Is one enough?

618
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:07,680
It's enough.

619
00:28:12,200 --> 00:28:13,759
Wanna go play with Uncle Liao today?

620
00:28:14,440 --> 00:28:15,079
Yes!

621
00:28:15,640 --> 00:28:17,799
Are we going to the amusement park again?

622
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:18,519
No.

623
00:28:19,519 --> 00:28:21,200
Today you're visiting the unit with me.

624
00:28:21,720 --> 00:28:22,640
Yay! Yay!

625
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:24,039
Yay! Yay! Let's go.

626
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:25,039
Is that okay?

627
00:28:25,160 --> 00:28:26,039
Of course it is.

628
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,200
I'm on leave. Get your water bottle.

629
00:28:27,759 --> 00:28:28,079
I got it.

630
00:28:28,079 --> 00:28:28,480
Be good.

631
00:28:29,799 --> 00:28:30,720
Okay, let's go.

632
00:28:34,279 --> 00:28:34,599
Let's go.

633
00:28:35,519 --> 00:28:35,880
Let's go.

634
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,240
Lü Xiao, fall in.

635
00:28:52,640 --> 00:28:53,319
Make up for what you missed.

636
00:28:53,759 --> 00:28:54,039
Yes, sir.

637
00:29:03,079 --> 00:29:05,319
That... that's more like it.

638
00:29:18,839 --> 00:29:19,720
Don't hold back!

639
00:29:20,079 --> 00:29:21,960
If anyone slacks off, you'll answer to me.

640
00:29:22,039 --> 00:29:22,279
Understood!

641
00:29:36,799 --> 00:29:37,759
How are you doing?

642
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,319
Still feeling unwell?

643
00:29:41,680 --> 00:29:43,680
Then why aren't you resting in your dorm?

644
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:47,119
I'll rest after I finish fixing this.

645
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:53,240
Our training right now

646
00:29:54,079 --> 00:29:56,359
is progressing steadily.

647
00:29:57,079 --> 00:29:58,640
But we've run into a small problem.

648
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,880
As the Commissar,

649
00:30:04,599 --> 00:30:05,680
I'd like to discuss it with you.

650
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:08,119
Keep doing what you're doing.

651
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:10,000
I'll just talk.

652
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:15,720
The team members are worried about you.

653
00:30:16,799 --> 00:30:19,799
It's affecting their state of mind.

654
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:23,039
Punish them if needed.

655
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:25,319
Ideological discipline

656
00:30:25,880 --> 00:30:27,359
is your area of expertise.

657
00:30:28,039 --> 00:30:30,240
It's natural to worry about their captain.

658
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:32,440
As leaders,

659
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:33,960
we should show some warmth.

660
00:30:39,279 --> 00:30:41,640
I wanted to discuss your brothers.

661
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:43,039
About their state of mind.

662
00:30:43,279 --> 00:30:43,880
Comrades-in-arms.

663
00:30:47,119 --> 00:30:48,240
Right, comrades-in-arms.

664
00:30:49,519 --> 00:30:50,039
Comrades-in-arms.

665
00:30:50,680 --> 00:30:51,680
They are completely

666
00:30:59,359 --> 00:31:00,319
slacking off.

667
00:31:03,359 --> 00:31:03,799
All right.

668
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:07,200
I'll deal with them when I return.

669
00:31:08,519 --> 00:31:10,440
The Combat Skills Competition can't wait.

670
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:12,720
A couple of days won't make a difference.

671
00:31:14,319 --> 00:31:16,079
Tell the truth. What are you waiting for?

672
00:32:32,119 --> 00:32:33,799
Hello, Commissar Tan.

673
00:32:34,799 --> 00:32:35,759
Any instructions?

674
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,039
No instructions.

675
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:38,400
Is everyone doing well at home?

676
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:40,920
Doing great, everything's great.

677
00:32:41,359 --> 00:32:42,799
I just went to the market for groceries.

678
00:32:44,519 --> 00:32:46,200
Having a party tonight? At home?

679
00:32:46,759 --> 00:32:48,680
No, just cooking a nice meal for my wife.

680
00:32:49,079 --> 00:32:50,079
Good, good, good.

681
00:32:50,599 --> 00:32:52,119
It's... it's not easy being a police wife.

682
00:32:52,119 --> 00:32:52,880
Be more understanding.

683
00:32:53,680 --> 00:32:55,480
Family harmony comes first.

684
00:32:56,119 --> 00:32:56,640
You're absolutely right.

685
00:32:57,920 --> 00:32:58,920
Don't worry, don't worry.

686
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:01,880
About the reassignment...

687
00:33:02,279 --> 00:33:03,880
Let me carefully look around

688
00:33:04,599 --> 00:33:05,720
for a good position for you.

689
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:06,440
Absolutely.

690
00:33:07,839 --> 00:33:08,319
Commissar Tan,

691
00:33:09,240 --> 00:33:10,720
thanks for always keeping me in mind.

692
00:33:11,279 --> 00:33:12,319
Thank you, thank you.

693
00:33:13,839 --> 00:33:14,920
How's the team doing lately?

694
00:33:15,400 --> 00:33:15,920
Any better?

695
00:33:16,119 --> 00:33:17,200
Not good at all.

696
00:33:18,400 --> 00:33:20,599
Commander Liao is on leave,

697
00:33:21,160 --> 00:33:24,400
and the team's training is terrible.

698
00:33:26,279 --> 00:33:27,119
What should we do about it?

699
00:33:28,279 --> 00:33:29,720
We can't let it go on like this.

700
00:33:30,440 --> 00:33:31,160
What are your thoughts?

701
00:33:33,279 --> 00:33:35,440
What are your thoughts, Captain Liu?

702
00:33:36,920 --> 00:33:37,640
Me?

703
00:33:39,279 --> 00:33:41,440
I'm afraid that won't work.

704
00:33:42,200 --> 00:33:42,799
Well, I...

705
00:33:43,279 --> 00:33:45,240
found some foreign Special Police Unit

706
00:33:45,799 --> 00:33:46,920
training videos.

707
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:49,880
I'll have everyone watch them tonight

708
00:33:50,119 --> 00:33:51,039
to properly learn from them.

709
00:33:51,599 --> 00:33:52,319
Let them see for themselves,

710
00:33:52,920 --> 00:33:54,720
so they stop acting like such hotshots.

711
00:33:55,440 --> 00:33:56,880
They're really far behind, honestly.

712
00:33:57,720 --> 00:33:59,119
Do you have time tonight?

713
00:33:59,319 --> 00:34:00,119
Come watch with us.

714
00:34:02,079 --> 00:34:03,039
It's a rare opportunity.

715
00:34:03,079 --> 00:34:04,039
I know, Commissar Tan.

716
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:05,880
I actually really want to go,

717
00:34:07,880 --> 00:34:10,519
but you know how my wife is.

718
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:13,400
I'm still a bit nervous.

719
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:17,519
Family harmony comes first.

720
00:34:20,599 --> 00:34:21,880
You're hopeless.

721
00:34:29,719 --> 00:34:30,639
You're the hopeless one.

722
00:35:27,119 --> 00:35:27,679
Lü Xiao

723
00:35:28,199 --> 00:35:29,360
What's up?

724
00:35:30,760 --> 00:35:32,000
I'm cooking for Mrs. Liu.

725
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:34,960
What else? Scrambled eggs with tomatoes.

726
00:35:36,519 --> 00:35:37,000
What?

727
00:35:38,960 --> 00:35:40,800
Commander Liao was suspended?

728
00:35:42,320 --> 00:35:42,920
What happened?

729
00:35:43,360 --> 00:35:43,719
He said...

730
00:35:46,679 --> 00:35:47,360
he's on extended leave?

731
00:35:48,079 --> 00:35:49,920
But the Combat Skills Competition is soon.

732
00:35:49,920 --> 00:35:50,960
It's only a few months away.

733
00:35:51,440 --> 00:35:52,119
Exactly.

734
00:35:52,760 --> 00:35:54,400
Who's in charge of the daily training now?

735
00:35:56,239 --> 00:35:57,000
Commissar Tan?

736
00:35:57,039 --> 00:35:58,440
Does Commissar Tan even understand this?

737
00:35:58,440 --> 00:36:00,039
He doesn't know the operations!

738
00:36:03,360 --> 00:36:03,760
What?

739
00:36:04,960 --> 00:36:07,039
Bai Jiani's face... it got slashed?

740
00:36:07,639 --> 00:36:08,079
How did that happen?

741
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:10,719
She got seven or eight stitches?

742
00:36:14,559 --> 00:36:16,239
What is going on with you guys?

743
00:36:17,719 --> 00:36:18,639
For a young girl...

744
00:36:18,639 --> 00:36:19,840
isn't she disfigured now?

745
00:36:21,000 --> 00:36:22,239
I've only been gone for a few days.

746
00:36:22,239 --> 00:36:24,320
How did you cause so much trouble?

747
00:36:26,960 --> 00:36:27,280
No, wait.

748
00:36:28,039 --> 00:36:29,199
So what does Commissar Tan mean by that?

749
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,000
He wants me back?

750
00:36:38,599 --> 00:36:39,320
I know.

751
00:36:39,440 --> 00:36:41,119
The Special Police Unit really needs me.

752
00:36:41,480 --> 00:36:43,199
But Mrs. Liu needs me even more right now.

753
00:36:43,199 --> 00:36:44,760
I promised her before.

754
00:36:44,880 --> 00:36:46,440
Once I came back, I wouldn't leave again.

755
00:36:47,199 --> 00:36:47,639
Right.

756
00:36:49,519 --> 00:36:51,880
A man has to keep his word, doesn't he?

757
00:36:52,480 --> 00:36:53,000
Temporarily?

758
00:36:53,199 --> 00:36:54,159
Not even temporarily.

759
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:55,960
You don't need to make him beg me.

760
00:36:56,440 --> 00:36:57,719
And you begging me won't work either.

761
00:36:58,039 --> 00:36:58,960
Let me tell you, the training...

762
00:36:59,159 --> 00:36:59,639
Lü Xiao.

763
00:36:59,679 --> 00:37:01,599
If you want what's best for your coach...

764
00:37:01,599 --> 00:37:02,639
you shouldn't keep...

765
00:37:06,480 --> 00:37:08,440
Your phone is upside down.

766
00:37:09,480 --> 00:37:10,840
Are you putting on an act for me?

767
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:16,159
Pretty good acting.

768
00:37:16,880 --> 00:37:18,760
Honey, let me explain.

769
00:37:19,960 --> 00:37:21,719
The team really needs me right now.

770
00:37:22,639 --> 00:37:24,320
There's no one to lead the daily training.

771
00:37:26,559 --> 00:37:27,639
Forget it. Forget it.

772
00:37:29,719 --> 00:37:31,119
The earth keeps spinning without you.

773
00:37:31,280 --> 00:37:31,760
Don't you think?

774
00:38:25,840 --> 00:38:27,400
Your underwear and socks are inside.

775
00:38:27,639 --> 00:38:29,159
Training is intense, change them daily.

776
00:38:30,719 --> 00:38:31,639
Don't be sloppy.

777
00:38:48,559 --> 00:38:50,239
What are you doing in broad daylight?

778
00:38:52,000 --> 00:38:53,119
You're the best.

779
00:38:54,079 --> 00:38:55,119
Thank you.

780
00:38:58,760 --> 00:39:00,239
Let me make this clear.

781
00:39:00,960 --> 00:39:02,280
It's only temporary.

782
00:39:03,039 --> 00:39:04,519
You're not going back for good.

783
00:39:05,039 --> 00:39:05,519
Understood.

784
00:39:07,559 --> 00:39:07,960
And another thing.

785
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:11,119
My dad has a hospital checkup on Saturday.

786
00:39:11,159 --> 00:39:12,159
I can't handle it on my own.

787
00:39:12,760 --> 00:39:14,719
You have to come back no matter what.

788
00:39:14,719 --> 00:39:15,280
Got it?

789
00:39:16,119 --> 00:39:17,199
Don't worry, honey.

790
00:39:18,239 --> 00:39:19,239
For important family matters,

791
00:39:19,840 --> 00:39:21,159
I'd never dare miss them.

792
00:39:22,079 --> 00:39:22,559
Plus,

793
00:39:23,719 --> 00:39:25,360
I'm answering a brother's call this time.

794
00:39:26,199 --> 00:39:27,159
After the Combat Skills Competition,

795
00:39:27,960 --> 00:39:29,199
I'll accept reassignment immediately.

796
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:29,920
Alright?

797
00:39:30,320 --> 00:39:31,039
No one can change my mind.

798
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:33,360
I can promise you, I swear.

799
00:39:33,960 --> 00:39:34,840
I solemnly promise.

800
00:39:35,800 --> 00:39:36,719
Your promises...

801
00:39:37,679 --> 00:39:39,159
...are just hot air.

802
00:39:48,360 --> 00:39:49,360
Safety first.

803
00:39:50,719 --> 00:39:51,239
Don't worry.

804
00:39:52,119 --> 00:39:53,320
I won't be the one on the front lines.

805
00:40:13,119 --> 00:40:15,039
Captain Liu, you're back.

806
00:40:15,440 --> 00:40:16,840
Surprised? Caught you off guard?

807
00:40:17,079 --> 00:40:18,599
A total surprise.

808
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:20,239
About the reassignment you just mentioned...

809
00:40:21,039 --> 00:40:22,519
My wife and I are taking it seriously.

810
00:40:22,559 --> 00:40:23,280
You can't lie to me.

811
00:40:23,280 --> 00:40:24,119
You're a big leader now.

812
00:40:25,199 --> 00:40:26,760
You're a real lifesaver.

813
00:40:27,039 --> 00:40:28,320
I'll write a pledge and add my thumbprint.

814
00:40:28,400 --> 00:40:30,360
Great, I'll frame it and hang it.

815
00:40:30,440 --> 00:40:31,159
Hang it on the wall.

816
00:40:35,199 --> 00:40:35,639
Captain Liu.

817
00:40:36,159 --> 00:40:37,280
We need to step up the training.

818
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:38,559
Prepare for the Combat Skills Competition.

819
00:40:38,840 --> 00:40:39,800
Rest assured, Commissar Tan.

820
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:41,960
We must get a good score this time.

821
00:40:42,159 --> 00:40:43,280
We have to get first place.

822
00:40:43,280 --> 00:40:44,119
If we don't get first place...

823
00:40:44,239 --> 00:40:46,000
I can't even ask the leaders for favors.

824
00:40:46,679 --> 00:40:47,920
You don't even leave a backup plan.

825
00:40:48,079 --> 00:40:49,039
Why are you exactly like Commander Liao?

826
00:40:49,039 --> 00:40:49,719
No backups, no backups.

827
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:50,719
None at all.

828
00:40:51,320 --> 00:40:52,639
Good, love the confidence. Let's go.

829
00:40:53,119 --> 00:40:53,400
Let's go.

830
00:40:53,719 --> 00:40:55,000
Go, go, go! Push yourselves!

831
00:40:55,800 --> 00:40:57,639
Hurry, hurry!

832
00:41:00,559 --> 00:41:02,760
You guys are too slow over here. Hurry!

833
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:04,599
Hurry up!

834
00:41:05,559 --> 00:41:06,920
Go, go, go!

835
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:09,119
I want intensity right now! Intensity!

836
00:41:09,119 --> 00:41:09,719
Hurry!

837
00:41:11,039 --> 00:41:12,440
You guys flipping tires over there!

838
00:41:13,480 --> 00:41:13,920
Hurry!

839
00:41:14,719 --> 00:41:15,239
Don't stop!

840
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:19,400
Go, go, go!

841
00:41:21,400 --> 00:41:22,639
Your team is falling behind!

842
00:41:24,360 --> 00:41:25,840
Flip those tires!

843
00:41:26,800 --> 00:41:28,320
Hurry, hurry! Don't just stand there!

844
00:41:34,840 --> 00:41:35,320
Alright!

845
00:41:36,119 --> 00:41:37,480
Rest in place for 15 minutes!

846
00:41:37,840 --> 00:41:38,639
Prepare for the next event!

847
00:41:45,280 --> 00:41:46,119
Don't sit down!

848
00:41:46,599 --> 00:41:48,400
Your glutes are pumped after training.

849
00:41:48,400 --> 00:41:49,239
Make sure you don't sit down!

850
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:50,039
Or you'll get a big butt!

851
00:41:52,239 --> 00:41:54,320
Our training needs to be scientific.

852
00:41:54,840 --> 00:41:56,239
We can't just train blindly.

853
00:41:57,599 --> 00:41:58,639
The Combat Skills Competition is soon.

854
00:41:58,639 --> 00:41:59,960
I know you're all very excited.

855
00:42:00,199 --> 00:42:01,239
But you need to restrain yourselves.

856
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:03,960
If you get injured, it's all over.

857
00:42:04,840 --> 00:42:06,360
You have to know when to push yourselves.

858
00:42:06,639 --> 00:42:07,639
And when to rest.

859
00:42:07,800 --> 00:42:08,559
Understood?

860
00:42:08,760 --> 00:42:09,440
Understood!

861
00:42:09,920 --> 00:42:10,199
Good.

862
00:42:10,800 --> 00:42:12,119
Well said, well said, Captain Liu.

863
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:13,559
When we're resting...

864
00:42:14,320 --> 00:42:15,480
We also need to learn...

865
00:42:15,920 --> 00:42:17,960
how to appreciate this beautiful scenery.

866
00:42:18,639 --> 00:42:20,159
Lü Xiao, let's start a Song battle.

867
00:42:20,280 --> 00:42:20,639
Lü Xiao.

868
00:42:21,519 --> 00:42:22,679
Commissar, I'm really bad at this.

869
00:42:23,039 --> 00:42:25,000
You sang pretty well in the Karaoke room.

870
00:42:27,199 --> 00:42:27,480
I really can't.

871
00:42:27,480 --> 00:42:28,440
I'll do it. Let me do it.

872
00:42:30,280 --> 00:42:33,599
"He says this little bit of pain..."

873
00:42:33,719 --> 00:42:35,199
"...is nothing," right?

874
00:42:35,440 --> 00:42:39,360
"He says this pain in the storm is nothing!"

875
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:40,239
Ready, sing!

876
00:43:12,119 --> 00:43:13,280
I haven't been home all month.

877
00:43:13,280 --> 00:43:14,440
But the utility meters have been running.

878
00:43:14,920 --> 00:43:16,239
Someone's definitely been living here.

879
00:43:16,920 --> 00:43:18,119
Notify CID and Narcotics.

880
00:43:18,599 --> 00:43:19,360
Regarding the Luzhong Murder Case,

881
00:43:19,400 --> 00:43:21,159
the two suspects at large...

882
00:43:21,280 --> 00:43:22,800
We finally have a clear lead on them.

883
00:43:23,079 --> 00:43:23,960
Get your things ready.

884
00:43:24,639 --> 00:43:25,400
Wait for my call.

885
00:43:25,400 --> 00:43:26,440
Keep them all together

886
00:43:26,440 --> 00:43:27,840
and get them on the boat safely.

887
00:43:28,599 --> 00:43:28,840
Understood.

888
00:43:29,159 --> 00:43:31,360
The City Bureau wants us to meet tomorrow.

889
00:43:31,760 --> 00:43:32,840
There might be a big operation.

890
00:43:33,400 --> 00:43:35,119
All right, I'll pick you guys up tomorrow.

891
00:43:35,119 --> 00:43:35,679
Let's go. Let's go.
